<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on 6.25 percent Bund due 2024.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on 6.25 percent Bund due 2024.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it has</p>
<p>issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six</p>
<p>equal tranches, on the 6.25 percent Bund due 2024.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.SEP.96-15.SEP.97   PAYDATE	26.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  91.32 PERCENT</p>
<p>* * * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	  88.00 PCT  3.78 DEM  0.50 PCT    24.16 X</p>
<p> CALL	  90.00 PCT  2.66 DEM  1.47 PCT    34.33 X</p>
<p> CALL	  95.00 PCT  0.91 DEM  5.03 PCT    100.35 X</p>
<p> PUT	   82.00 PCT  1.01 DEM  11.31 PCT   90.42 X</p>
<p> PUT	   85.00 PCT  1.82 DEM  9.91 PCT    50.18 X</p>
<p> PUT	   88.00 PCT  3.07 DEM  7.00 PCT    29.75 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
